{
 "id": 11386,
 "titulo": "Update : 1.3.0 Version Details",
 "fecha": 1436271581137,
 "modificada": 1732664251744,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/11386",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Greetings, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D!</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">We are happy to share the news about the upcoming MARVEL Future Fight update with you.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Get ready to meet&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">5 new Heroes</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;and experience&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Ant-Man Special missions</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">!</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">You will be able to join forces with other p&#108;ayers and experience the new&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Alliance system</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">!</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">The newly introduced</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">will allow you to send heroes to missions and convert Biometrics!</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">We want to give you a sneak peek into the newly added heroes and systems so please check below for details!</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #ff33cc;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;5 new Heroes added</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">5 new Heroes including&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Ant-Man</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;will help you in your battle to save the world.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 668px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176210290.png\" /><br /> <img id=\"Ywyvyprn9zs\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ywyvyprn9zs/sddefault.jpg\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">There will be new team bonuses including the new Heroes. You will also see some changes in terms of strikers.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">New achievements that require achieving maximum level for the new characters will be added to Quest achievements tab.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">It will be possible to get Ant-Man Heroes and their biometrics through</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Dimension Chests and Hero Chests as well as through Elite missions.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;Special missions improvements and new special missions</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">You will be able to easily enter Special missions by choosing the story you wish to play.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176226846.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Meet the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Guardians of the Galaxy (6 chapters)</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">and the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Ant-Man heroes (5 chapters)&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">through Special missions</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">!</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">You can easily enter the desired story by pressing the thumbnail.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176230745.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">In the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">new</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Ant-Man Special missions&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">you will have to thwart the evil plans of M.O.D.O.K. who intends to use Pym Particles that are capable of reducing or increasing scale of any form of matter.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">The new Special missions will allow you to experience such phenomena as the increasing or decreasing your body size.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Some chapters will also allow you to acquire Biometrics for the new characters</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">.</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176218716.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #339966;\"><strong>- Look at the buildings behind. Don't they resemble toy houses?</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #9933ff;\"><strong># Meet new Dimension shifters in the new Special missions!</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176221518.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Generally you can meet Dimension Shifters only in Normal and Elite missions, but we decided to give you a chance to get extra rewards, sending</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #ff0000;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #9933ff;\"><strong>Ant-Man heroes as Dimension shifters</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;to&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">newly added Special missions</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">. They will show up in Ant-Man Special missions with a certain probability.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #ff33cc;\">※ There's no limit for Ant-Man Dimension shifters in Special missions, it doesn't affect the daily Dimension shifters limit.</span><br /> <br /> <strong><span style=\"color: #006400;\">NOTE: Shifters in Special missions are not guaranteed to drop biometrics like normal shifters. There is a random chance to get the biometrics from the shifter.&nbsp;</span></strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;Alliance system added</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">We are introducing a new&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Alliance system</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;that allows you to form alliances</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">with other p&#108;ayers and get various benefits.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 453px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176238099.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">You can form an Alliance using a certain amount of gold and become its Leader.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Members of the Alliance can grow through EXP that they get form clearing Alliance missions.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #ff33cc;\">※ Alliance EXP cannot be acquired when using Clear Tickets.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Alliance members will get different bonuses depending on the Alliance level.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">The higher the level of your Alliance, the better the bonus will be.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 496px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176241287.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #9933ff;\"><strong>- Try to grow your Alliance and make it more powerful!</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 633px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/null/2015/07/06/1436176243739.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">After clearing the Alliance missions you will be able to get rewards through fulfilling achievements.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #ff33cc;\">※ The reset time for the daily and weekly Alliance achievements will be specified in the Achievements window.<br /> &nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab added</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;In the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab, by using Antimatter you can convert Biometrics, send heroes to missions etc.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436258539225.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/${boardId}/2015/07/10/1436492906658.png\" /><br /> <span style=\"color: #ff33cc;\"><strong>- To use all the machines in the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab you will need Anti-Matter!</strong></span><br /> &nbsp;The Anti-Matter Generator will allow you to generate and store antimatter substances.<br /> Generated antimatter substances can be used to power the machines in the S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab as well build and upgrade them.<br /> <br /> <img style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/${boardId}/2015/07/10/1436492909169.png\" /><br /> Biometric Converter is a machine that allows you to convert Anti-Matter into Biometrics. There's a daily limit of Anti-Matter that can be converted into Biometrics.<br /> <span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">※ After you choose the Converter you will be able to </span><span style=\"color: #ff33cc;\"><strong>check the daily limit</strong></span><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">.</span><br /> <br /> <img style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/${boardId}/2015/07/10/1436492913427.png\" /><br /> Dimension Warp Device will allow you to send your heroes to other Dimension Rifts<br /> and train them through clearing these missions.<br /> <br /> <img style=\"font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/futurefight_en/${boardId}/2015/07/10/1436492916316.png\" /><br /> Dimension Shop will allow you to purchase items from other dimensions using Anti-Matter.<br /> Items in the Dimension Shop are sold for the limited time, after which the item list is renewed.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣ Change of items in the Token shops</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">Some Biometrics sold in the Honor Token and Chaos Token shops will be changed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">1.&nbsp;Changes in the Honor Token Shop</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; width: 373px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436265032187.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">2. Changes in the Chaos Token Shop</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; width: 376px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436265034019.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;New items added to the Shop</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">1. Code Name Changer</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">There is a new item that will allow you to change your MFF Code Name.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/null/2015/07/07/1436265450822.png\" /><img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/null/2015/07/07/1436265454202.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">If you press a &#98;utton the item will be&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff33cc;\">immediately purchased with crystals</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;and you will be able to change your Code Name straight away.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #9933ff;\">※ It's is not possible to take a name that is already in use or a name that includes prohibited words.</span></strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 674px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/null/2015/07/07/1436265456385.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff33cc;\"><strong>- If you don't use this item, it goes into&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #9933ff;\"><strong>Inventory &gt; Consumable.</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #3366ff; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">▣</strong><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">Two new Uniforms added</span></strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">2 exclusive Uniforms for Ant-Man and Giant-Man will be available for purchase.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; width: 573px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436265037782.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px; width: 611px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/null/2015/07/07/1436265509249.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;Two new 6 star skills added (Spider-Man, Black Widow)</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">Spider-Man and Black Widow get 6 star skills.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">- Spider-Man &ndash; Wrecking Web</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">- Black Widow &ndash; Coup de Gr&acirc;ce&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; width: 630px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436265042772.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #9933ff;\"><strong>- 6 star skills are finally introduced through this update! Expect to see brand new skills in future, as we plan to gradually add 6 star skills for other heroes!&nbsp;</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;MFF App icon changed</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <img style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; width: 414px;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.net/images/puble/community/ETC/QUICKBOY_ko/$%7BboardId%7D/2015/07/07/1436265023139.png\" /><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">Now that the Ant-Man joins MARVEL Future Fight, app icon is changed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3366ff;\"><strong>▣</strong><strong>&nbsp;Other game improvements</strong></span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">[Hero Improvements]&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">1. Issue with abnormally low damage from Black Bolt's Electron Channeling skill was fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">2. Issue with the Special Gear&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #339966;\">[Resist Device: Slow]</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">, did not work on the Anti-Gravity Field in Ronan's Special Mission has been resolved.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">3. Issue with Hero preview fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff0066;\">&nbsp;- Applies to the following heroes: Thor, Ultron, Loki, Destroyer, Ronan, Vision, War Machine, Malekith, M.O.D.O.K., Iron Man, Groot, Doctor Octopus, Luke Cage, Venom, Kingpin, Hulkbuster (Iron Man Mark 44)</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">4. Lagging issue caused by the Falcon's All-New Captain America uniform was fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">[Bug fixes and game improvements]</strong><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">1. The issue with Heroes going through Barriers in certain situation was fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">2. A new downtown theme was added to Timeline battle.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">3. Villains' rank in Guardians of the Galaxy Special missions was adjusted.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff0066;\">&nbsp;- Changes: All #4 stages (3 stars before adjustment &gt; 4 stars)<br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; All #5 stages (4 stars before adjustment &gt; 5 stars)</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">4. Energy Recharge item image was improved.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">5. If you press a Hero's name on the idle screen you will be taken to the Hero page with all the information about the Hero.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">6. When you choose a Uniform on the Uniform page, there will be a banner in case if this Uniform is available through a Uniform pack.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">7. Reset time for Villain Siege will be shown in the bottom left corner instead of the top right corner. The explanation for the Reset time was added.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">8. Now you can check name of the Villain Siege Rewards.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">9. In the Daily mission 'The Madness in the light of Yellow #4' M.O.D.O.K.'s type was corrected from 'Combat' to 'Blast'.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">10. The issue with unusual functioning of Ultron's normal attack in case if he shows up as a Dimension Shifter was fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">11. Background in Normal and Elite missions was improved to show diverse atmosphere of dawn, morning, afternoon, dusk and evening.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\">12. The issue with freezing of Sakaaran Ranger in Special mission #6 'Courting Death' was fixed.</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\" /> <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13.3333330154419px;\">Thank you!</span></p>"
}